    desc: "Riset keyword, artikel SEO On-Page (70% SEO & Marketing) + 30% praktik koding dasar Bootstrap & Blogspot.",
    techs: ["Riset Keyword", "Artikel SEO", "Search Console", "Dasar Bootstrap"],
